  m_text: "This is actually Other Coral. Other Coral is any type of coral you see
    that\u2019s not branching, plating or boulder against surfaces, soft corals,
    or unusual growth patterns. If it doesn\u2019t clearly fit the three main categories,
    it\u2019s likely Other Coral."
